13. NS2 Simulator

i. Introduction:
NS2 is a network simulator used for analyzing protocols.

ii. Steps:
- Install NS2
- Write TCL script
- Run using:
  ns file.tcl

iii. Packet Drop:
Use trace file (.tr) and analyze dropped packets

iv. TCP/UDP Drop:
Simulate agents and measure packet loss

v. Congestion:
Create multiple nodes and links

vi. Throughput:
Calculate using received packets/time

vii. Performance:
Compare transmission rates and delays
